%description -n regolith-sway-audio-idle-inhibit
Earlier versions of this package started sway-audio-idle-inhibit from a sway
config partial. The sway-audio-idle-inhibit package now starts it as a
systemd user service, so this package is empty. It lets plain upgrades drop
the old partial without removing anything, and can be safely removed.

%package -n regolith-unclutter-xfixes
