%description -n regolith-unclutter-xfixes
Earlier versions of this package were Regolith's own build of
unclutter-xfixes. regolith-i3-unclutter now uses the distribution's
unclutter-xfixes, so this package is empty. It lets upgrades replace the
old build without removing any package, and can be safely removed.

